window.products.push({"id":1087011,"name":"Naomi Home Emery Chesterfield Love Seat Loveseat & Sofa with Rolled Arms, Tufted Cushions / 2 & 3 Seater Sectional Sofa Couch for Small Spaces, Living","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61JoadkNnyL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"THE CHESTERFIELD STYLE: The Emery Chesterfield Love Seat & Sofa Couch is a classic icon of design, stylish and comfortable. The Emery sectional sofa features deep button tufts and plush scrolled arms. The loveseat sofa has a padded back, provides diamond button details, and fitted removable seat cushions. Our love seat recliner sofa couch is easy to spot clean and is a classic and contemporary sofa designed to fit into any home decor. DEEP BUTTON TUFTING: Our loveseat sofa set offers both design and comfort, featuring deep button tufting across the backrest, armrests, and seating. The loveseat sleeper sofa has tufting that allows for breathing space while you relax, limiting the amount of heat that is generated. ROLLED ARMS: To complete the refined Chesterfield look, this couch sectional features beautifully rolled arms. Couches for small spaces add an air of sophistication to your room and compliment the tufted diamond stitching. This small loveseat for small spaces provides a more comfortable place to lean against while relaxing on your sofa. The sofa cushion is built with a firm hardwood frame, faux leather for a thick padded support, and solid wooden legs. LOW PROFILE: This loveseat sofa bed offers a low profile build, which makes it perfect for smaller spaces and keeps your room from feeling cluttered. You will surely love how much your space can transform with the simple addition of this charming sofa. PRODUCT DIMENSIONS: Sofa – 30.70\" H x 88.58\" W x 30.70\" D, Weight: 132.3 Lbs; Loveseat – 30.70\" H x 66.53\" W x 30.70\" D, Weight: 88.2 Lbs. TURNED WOODEN LEGS: This club chair is supported by beautifully turned wooden legs, which offer an attractive look and durable structure. Its fine grain takes stains well, bringing a gorgeous handcrafted feel that is highly decorative and eye-catching. Finished with gracefully turned legs, this chair is the epitome of exquisite design. EASY ASSEMBLY: You can assemble it in minutes with step-by-step instructions, and no tools are required for assembly. Our proprietary packaging ensures the safe delivery of the small sectional sofa to your home. This 2 & 3 seat sofa set comes with a 90 Day Manufacturer's Warranty and, in the unlikely event that you are not satisfied with our sofa, our Customer support will assist you with refunds/replacements.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61JoadkNnyL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Naomi Home","source_asin":"B07H8N7YJ8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1087011","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07H8N7YJ8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07H8N7YJ8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
