window.products.push({"id":1087134,"name":"Lucccase Non Slip Bathtub Stickers 24 Pieces Cute Sea Creature Print for Kids Shower Strong Adhesive Appliques Anti-Slip Decals for Tub Stairs Kitchen","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":12.19,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ZoAF4Rg-S._AC_SL1099_.jpg","description":"🐟Your bathtub should be a haven of security, not a slippery accident waiting to happen. That's why we created bathtub stickers  to enhance overall safety. Our nonslip bathtub stickers set works the same way a tub mat does only that it's easier to set up. It's also lighter and easier to maintain. You only need to stick the individual stickers on the inner surface of your bathtub. 🐟These non-slip bathtub stickers are effective to stick to any smooth surface, such as a bathtub, bathroom floor or stairs, swimming pool, etc. They provide strong adhesion and good grip, effectively preventing slipping and ensuring safety for your kids, parents and yourselves. 🐟The sea creature decals not only anti-slip, but also for decoration. It is suitable for any smooth, dry, non-textured surface, such as bathtubs, floors, stairs, doors, mirrors, windows, desks, walls, etc., to put you in the ocean world. 🐟Installation Instructions 1. The surface to be used needs to be cleaned before application to keep it dry and free of particles. 2.First locate a corner to determine the position, and use the card to smooth out the bubbles while facing the edge. 3. Keep it fully attached to the surface to prevent warping after lamination. 4. Try to complete it at one time when attaching the stickers. Repeated movement and hand contact will affect the adhesion. 5. Keep the stickers away from water within 2 hours.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ZoAF4Rg-S._AC_SL1099_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Lucccase","source_asin":"B098T6YMWJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1087134","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B098T6YMWJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B098T6YMWJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
