window.products.push({"id":1087264,"name":"Silver One Stainless Steel 3 Piece- 17oz Pineapple Copper-Finish Cocktail Mug w Straw & 2 Pineapple Shot Cups","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71FVWNqi7bL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The True Signature Of Moscow Mule Is The Copper Mug – Now You Can Have It! - Copper Finish mugs are hands down the best choice for mixing up the best Moscow Mule recipe.Thousands of people agree that when sipping a Moscow Mule from a copper finish mug, their drink tastes better. Another huge benefit of this copper mug is that it keeps your drink cold as ice for hours. The longer the chill, the better the drink. Right?Follow The Long Held Tradition Of Moscow Mule – Enjoy Your Drink In A Copper Finish Mug! - Are you sick and tired of drinking dull cocktails, as soon after their preparation they start getting warmer, no matter how many ice cubes you have used? If you want to take the most out of your favorite drink, serving it in a copper finish mug is a must!  History Twist - Although there is debate about the beginnings of the Moscow Mule, there is no debate about its lasting legacy. Some say the inventors had a stroke of genius, while others claim it was simply created in an effort to go through a plentiful stash of both vodka and ginger beer. Whether it was a marketing effort or a stroke of luck, we're convinced it was the mug that made the mule  Enhancing Taste To Your Beverage - The copper finish mug enhances the flavor and keeps the drink colder, longer.  Mix It Up Add pineapple to your mojitio for additional sweetness and a tropical twist to this classic cocktail. Surprise your guests with a glass of refreshing liquid tropical sunshine. The Coctail Recipe1. Muddle together 8 mint leaves, 2 lime wedges and 1 tbsp of sugar2. Stir in 2 tbsp pineapple juice, 2 tbsp crushed pineapple, and rum3. Add ice cubes and a splash of club soda. Sip and ENJOY!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71FVWNqi7bL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SILVER ONE","source_asin":"B0749695H4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1087264","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0749695H4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0749695H4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
