window.products.push({"id":1087297,"name":"Fox Run Christmas Cookie Cutter Set, Stainless Steel, 4-Piece","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.5,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71sl0S5C76L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Deck the halls! Fun and festive, this cookie cutter set makes tasty versions of your favorite Christmas shapes. This four piece set includes a Santa, stocking, tree, and sleigh design. Constructed of sturdy stainless steel, these cutters have an attractive shine and luster that will be best preserved when hand washed and dried completely after use. Make uniform cut-out cookies that kids will love decorating to leave out for Santa next to a tall glass of milk. Also great for fondant or crafts, this set is a must-have for the holidays.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71sl0S5C76L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Fox Run","source_asin":"B01LZV8KIX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1087297","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01LZV8KIX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01LZV8KIX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1087298,"name":"Simyolife Stovetop Espresso Maker Stainless Steel Italian Coffee Maker Moka Pot Induction-Capable Moka Coffee Machine Cafe Percolator Maker, Silver (9","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":22.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61-XeBVKMtL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Stainless Steel Design】Espresso coffee maker body through polishing design, smooth stainless steel material, three-ring precision thread, and pressure-tested safety valve to make your use process safer. The stainless steel espresso pot is durable, does not rust, the inner coating is heat-resistant, does not produce toxic substances, and has no smell, please feel free to use it. 【Easy to Use】When using the coffee maker for the first time, there may be an unpleasant smell. Rest assured, the odor index is within safe limits. Please add tea, oranges, detergent, or other items to remove odor and wash several times before use. Fill the lower part of the Italian espresso maker with water, put the ground coffee into the percolator, put the top on, and place the espresso pot on the cooker to boil. After using the stovetop espresso machine, please rinse it with clean water. 【Compatible with all Stovetops】This stovetop espresso maker is suitable for any stove, such as gas, induction stove, ceramic stove, electric stove, alcohol stove, and propane camping stove. You don't need to go out, you can easily make your favorite lattes, mochas, smoothies, macchiatos, cappuccinos, and americanos.Because of its excellent anti-corrosion and rust resistance, it could be cleaned with a dishwasher. 【 Standard espresso coffee cup is 50ml 】With a quick and even heating, accompanied by a strong aroma, Simyolife’s espresso maker can make you a pot of 9 cups (450ml) of gourmet espresso in just five minutes, and you'll be instantly impressed by its rich taste and aroma.We use high-quality material to make the extraction pothole, make the coffee that makes it more mellow, and bring high-quality coffee to you to enjoy. 【After-sales guarantee】Please be attention that we provide long-term after-sales service for this stovetop coffee maker. At any time after receiving the goods, if there are any problems with the items (quality, function, etc.), please contact us in time, and we will solve the problem for you within 24 hours. We are confident in quality and functionality. If you are not satisfied with this, just return the item. 【TIPS】We have made corresponding adjustments according to the customer's suggestions on the product, and re-updated the quality and packaging of the product several times, hoping to give customers a good shopping experience and live up to the customer's support for SIMYOLIFE","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61-XeBVKMtL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Simyolife","source_asin":"B09WQXYJQX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1087298","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09WQXYJQX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09WQXYJQX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
