window.products.push({"id":1087302,"name":"Sasttie Silky Pillowcase (1, 1x2)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51he03-abyL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"【Hypoallergenic Down Alternative Filling】Sasttie pillow inserts are filled with generous synthetic down which is naturally hypoallergenic, ultra-soft, and lightweight. Thinly spun with 40% silicified fiber and 60% polyester fibers, our down alternative stuffing ensures enough softness and firmness. 【Elegant Striped Design】The shell of these couch pillow inserts is made from thickened fabric with a thread count of 300, which ensures none of the fill pokes through and causes discomfort. These throw pillows also designed with white stripes on the surface, and this concise pattern could spruce up your couch in no time. 【Various Sizes for Choosing】Our throw pillow inserts come in one rectangular size (12 by 20 inches) and four square-shaped sizes, the petite 16 by 16 inches, mid-range sizes that fit most couches (18 by 18 inches or 20 by 20 inches are usually the go-to size), and generously-sized 24 by 24 inches for the largest one available. 【Airtight Packing】The fluffy, soft yet firm insert is vacuum compressed and sealed for shipping purposes. Thus, it might not be fluffy enough when you opened the package. Please try to stretch the pillow insert back and forth, then pat it evenly, it may take 1-2 days to recover its perfect fluffy shape. 【Machine Washable】These sofa throw pillows are easy to care for. Just throw the cushion insert in the washer and dryer on a gentle cycle, and you can get a clean and fluffy pillow insert without any hassle.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51he03-abyL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Sasttie","source_asin":"B09NQ4M3GT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1087302","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09NQ4M3GT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09NQ4M3GT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
