window.products.push({"id":1087367,"name":"The Ibis Print Gallery - Charles Cromwell Ingham : ''The Flower Girl'' (1846) - Museum-Grade Giclee","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Ek6SZK6AL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Charles Cromwell Ingham's The Flower Girl is one of the iconic paintings of the Victorian era. Proffering flowers with her right hand, a young woman assumes a gesture emblematic of the goddess Flora, yet she wears the guise of an impoverished street vendor. Her magnificent bouquet is meant as an appeal, not a gift; she is vulnerable, not venerated. \"The expression on the girl's face,\" observes the Metropolitan Museum of Art, \"is psychologically complex and calls attention to the moral dilemma in which such lower class women often found themselves...On the one hand, her roseate cheeks, moist lips, and alluring beauty charge the picture with erotic overtones, as does the gesture with which she offers the fuchsias, often a symbol of love. It is as though the viewer were given the option of purchasing the flowers in her basket or the flower of her virtue while being simultaneously subjected to the most searching scrutiny.\" The Flower Girl was a seminal contribution to an emerging subgenre of paintings that depicted juvenile street vendors and homeless ragamuffins. Calling attention to the discrepancy between Victorian ideals of youthful innocence and the actual conditions being suffered by young women and children, these works added momentum to the reform movements that grew over the course of the 19th century.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Ek6SZK6AL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"The Ibis","source_asin":"B07TKHN4C8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1087367","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07TKHN4C8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07TKHN4C8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
