window.products.push({"id":1087416,"name":"White Knife Set with Block - 14 Piece Forged Stainless Steel Triple Rivet White Kitchen Knife Set with Heavy Duty Kitchen Shears and Self Sharpening K","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":109.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51PmsFDArCL._AC_.jpg","description":"ELEVATE YOUR KITCHEN WITH THIS LUXE WHITE KNIFE SET WITH SHARPENER – complement white kitchen decor with this stunning 14 piece modern kitchen knives set with block; white handle knife set includes chef's large kitchen knife, carving knife, bread knife, utility knife, paring knife, santoku knife, 6 white steak knives and stainless steel heavy duty kitchen shears, all housed in a wooden knife block with sharpener. OWN THE SHARPEST KNIVES ON THE BLOCK WITH THIS SELF SHARPENING KNIFE SET – our block knife sets are crafted of high-quality stainless steel which provides great toughness, corrosion resistance and edge retention for superb performance and included kitchen knife block features a unique built-in sharpener that ensures your cream knife set will stay razor sharp forever; we recommend hand washing and drying immediately to maintain the performance, look and lustre of your knife set white and silver PREMIUM QUALITY WHITE KNIVES SET FOR KITCHEN MAKES COOKING EASIER – outfit your home with this cohesive modern knife set with knife holder for kitchen counter; each of our white kitchen knives is ergonomically engineered with a comfort grip handle and crafted with a full-tang blade that is triple-riveted for durability and balance; prep meat, fish, vegetables, fruit, bread and more with ease with an array of self sharpening knives for any purpose in our knife block set white. STREAMLINE YOUR KITCHEN WITH THIS WHITE KNIFE BLOCK SET – eliminate mismatched sets or loose, dull knives cluttering drawers and enhance your kitchen with our silver and white knife set built in sharpener that's purposefully designed to complement white kitchen decor and accessories and be proudly displayed on your countertop; knife sets for kitchen with shears make a thoughtful holiday, wedding, housewarming or graduation gift. MAKE A MATCH WITH WHITE KITCHEN GADGETS AND MODERN KITCHEN ACCESSORIES FROM STYLED SETTINGS – in addition to our white knife sets for kitchen with block, upgrade the rest of your kitchen with our lineup of cute kitchen utensils and modern kitchenware including our white cooking utensils set, bakeware, white pots and pans and more; complement white appliances or white kitchen accessories and bring more joy into your kitchen with a touch of glam.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51PmsFDArCL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"STYLED SETTINGS","source_asin":"B0C6X3YJHS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1087416","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C6X3YJHS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C6X3YJHS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
