window.products.push({"id":1087418,"name":"Sable Village 4-in-1 Candle Care Kit - Wick Trimmer Set Trimmer, Snuffer, Dipper, Tray Stainless Accessories Tools Scissors to Trim Wicks. Snuff Candl","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/711nVbXtFSL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"You’ve spent time and money selecting the perfect decorative candles and scents for your home... Make them last longer and look their best with this 4-in-1 Candle Care Kit. Our premium set has everything you need for easy and efficient candle care.INCLUDES:1 x Candle Snuffer1 x Wick Trimmer1 x Wick Dipper1 x Storage TrayCANDLE SNUFFER MEANS NO WAX MESSA traditional bell style snuffer works by blocking air’s access to the wick, which extinguishes the flame while eliminating the risk of blowing hot wax all over tablecloths and furniture. Perfect for avoiding messes with taller candles like taper and pillar style.WICK TRIMMER PROLONGS CANDLE LIFEThe long-handled wick trimmer lets you easily reach the bottom of low candles to keep the wick trimmed to an ideal length of 1/4” – 1/2”. Trimming prevents the wick from burning too hot, which affects the fragrance and can make your candles burn up faster than necessary.WICK DIPPER PREVENTS SMOKE & SOOTUse the curved wick dipper to push the lit wick into the wax pool and extinguish the flame with no unpleasant smoke or smoldering. Restraighten the wick, which is now primed with wax for easy lighting next time. Ideal for votive, glass, and ornamental candles.ADD A TOUCH OF CHARM TO YOUR DECORThe tools and tray are crafted from high quality stainless steel for strength and durability. Easy to keep clean. An attractive black matte finish offers eye-catching visual appeal. Perfect for decorative display on a shelf, coffee table, or bedroom vanity. Keep all your candle accessories organized in one easy to reach place.Whether you consider yourself a candle connoisseur or are just starting your candle collection, get the most out of every future candle purchase with this 4-in-1 kit!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/711nVbXtFSL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Sable Village","source_asin":"B09DXY15SL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1087418","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09DXY15SL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09DXY15SL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
