window.products.push({"id":1087531,"name":"Asmdor Enameled Cast Iron Covered Dutch Oven with Dual Handle, Blue, 5 QT","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61e6WwUdNpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Ultra-Durable & Non-Stick: Heavy enamel-on-cast iron construction with a microporous, matte black interior offers enjoyable cooking without safety worries.Oil is absorbed into the micropores of the enameled cast iron,creating a non-stick surface highly resistant to scratching and chipping. Locking in Moisture: Condensation rings on the underside of the heavy lid act to circulate moisture,continuously redirecting moisture back into the food you are cooking to lock in moisture and flavor. Suitable for All Cooktops: Gas, electric,oven and open fire safe on low to medium heat.Cast iron exterior offers the benefits of even heat conductivity and distribution;the bottom may be darkened if it is used over open fire. Easy-to-Clean: Dishwasher safe, but hand washing is recommended.Cleaning by hand may help improve its durability.To remove difficult stains, soak in warm water for 1 to 2 hours or longer,and then use baking soda or neutral detergent to clean them off.Wash with regular detergent and water.Do not clean with a stainless-steel wire ball or other tools that may leave scratches.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61e6WwUdNpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"EDGING","source_asin":"B08H1LR6N7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1087531","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08H1LR6N7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08H1LR6N7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
