window.products.push({"id":1087596,"name":"Ergousit Home Office Chair, Ergonomic Office Chair with Large Seat Cushion, Computer Desk Chair with Flip-up Arms, Task Chair with Lumbar Support Mesh","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71GIAOPUWCL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Metal Base & Ergonomic Design】The unique Metal five-star base design makes our ergonomic desk chair more durable and more sturdy. Besides, Ergousit ergonomic office chair matches the human body very well. The adjustable lumbar support of the Ergousit modern desk chair can effectively reduce back pain caused by long time sitting. 【7CM Thick Large Seat Cushion】Sufficient seating space is the foundation for back support for office chairs to give people physical comfort. Ergousit heavy duty office chair has a large chair seat(20.87''x20.67''), it will not make you feel constrained. Besides, the seat cushion is made of high-density sponge, which is very suitable for a long sitting time. 【Multi-Function】Adjustable height & rocking function & 360° swivel desk chairs meet all your basic needs. Thick padded arms provide extra comfort. Recline office chair's casters and sturdy base is durable and makes sure you move smoothly and stably. The flip up armrests of Ergousit ergonomic mesh desk chair fits perfectly under your desk. It helps you save more space while providing comfortable support for your arms. 【Breathable & Comfortable】Ergousit mesh ergonomic office chair has a mesh backrest, it is more breathable and allows air to circulate. High-density sponge cushion and wide seat offer super comfort to your body. 【Easy assemble and 5-Year Warranty】Ergousit home office desk chairs is packaged with clear instruction and tools. It’s very easy to assemble. We also provide 5-year warranty and professional after-sale service. If there is any problem in use, contact us anytime and we will provide you a satisfied solution.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71GIAOPUWCL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Ergousit","source_asin":"B08X6ZL1JT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1087596","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08X6ZL1JT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08X6ZL1JT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1087597,"name":"Kay Dee Designs Cat Housekeeper Embroidered Waffle Towel, Various","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41VDXLDvrRL._AC_.jpg","description":"Do you own your cat, or does your cat own you? (Any cat owner knows the answer to this question!) This humorous waffle towel, perfect for any cat lover, features large, meticulous embroidery, a convenient loop for hanging, and thick waffle weave. The waffle weave makes this towel absorbent, and the embroidery makes it a personal statement for your kitchen, or a meaningful gift! Kay Dee Designs has been selling textiles for a well-dressed kitchen since 1951.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41VDXLDvrRL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Kay Dee","source_asin":"B013REQBLC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1087597","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B013REQBLC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B013REQBLC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1087598,"name":"HEYIA Touch Screen Digital Scales, Professional Kitchen Electronic Scale for Home Baking, 11 LB / 5 kg, LED Display, Powered by 2 * 3A Batteries (Not ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51UGo1vsdQL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Combining new advanced touch sensitive buttons, a tempered glass surface, and new GFX sensors, the HEYI Touch is one of the industry's most advanced digital kitchen scales. The HEYI Touch Digital Kitchen Scale features an elegant reflective black surface made out of high quality tempered glass that is 4 times stronger than normal glass. It includes 4 high precision GFX latest generation sensors to deliver superior accuracy and the fastest response times for the quick paced chef. The HEYI Touch Digital Kitchen Scale combines all this technology into a contemporary thin design and stands out as a show piece for the modern kitchen. Designed for the culinary perfectionist who desires superior accuracy and a showpiece design, the HEYI Touch is one of the lightest kitchen scales on the market and offers easy portability. The HEYI Touch also features an automatic Tare button that quickly calculates the net weight of your ingredients by subtracting the container weight, whether the container is a bowl, tray, plate or anything else. The HEYI Touch Digital Kitchen Scale has a capacity range from a mere 0.1 ounces to 176.37 oz, and provides measurements in graduations of 1 g or 0.1 oz on its bright LCD screen.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51UGo1vsdQL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BOGZON","source_asin":"B01ESM8WA0","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1087598","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01ESM8WA0","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01ESM8WA0","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1087599,"name":"Onebttl Birthday Gifts for Schnauzer Mom, Schnauzer Lovers Gifts for Women, Girls, Daughters, Friends, Granddaughters, Coworkers, Her Stainless Steel ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81FVFJrfWFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Top-tier gift for Schnauzer mom】The look of a mini schnauzer may differ, but they're all so cute! Sometimes dog moms will miss their dogs when at work. If you are looking for some meaningful gifts to wow the gift receiver, this stainless steel wine tumbler is an ideal gift for every Schnauzer lover! They can use it at home or in the office! 【Unique design with Schnauzer logo】The printed Schnauzer logo and the slogan [Schnauzer Mom] prove the gift receiver’s identity - a Schnauzer mom who loves her puppy! This well-made tumbler makes drinking more fun! The gift receiver will absolutely love this well-designed tumbler and show it to everyone! Perfect gift for a Schnauzer mom, dog mom, Schnauzer owner, women, girls, daughters, friends, coworkers, etc. 【Premium quality】All Onebttl tumblers are made from18/8 (304 food grade) stainless steel, eco-friendly. This tumbler is not only for drinking but for party deco as well! Pair it with your themed party! Everybody will be thrilled to sip a refreshing drink in Onebttl stainless steel tumblers! 【Multiple usage】12 oz (340 ml) capacity is ideal to hold all kinds of liquor like wine, cocktails, whiskey, mixed drinks, soda, beer, champagne, juice, hot or ice coffee, water, tea, smoothies, etc. Suitable for any indoor or outdoor activities. The BPA-FREE double-wall vacuum insulated 304 stainless steel wine tumbler keeps drinks cold for 9 hours or hot for 3 hours. 【Lifetime warranty】We are committed to providing our customers with the highest quality products and impeccable customer service. If for any reason you are not fully satisfied with your purchase, please reach out to Onebttl customer care. We’ll happily make things right!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81FVFJrfWFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Onebttl","source_asin":"B099ZTPG13","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1087599","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B099ZTPG13","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B099ZTPG13","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1087600,"name":"Laughing Moon Pasttern # 122/123 Combo","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81xsPLNI53L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Men’s Regency Tailcoat with Collar Notch and Lapel Options 1806-1820. This Tailcoat has no waist seam, no lapel/front seam and is double breasted with the bottom 3 buttons meant to be buttoned. When buttoned the collar and lapels bow out to make room for shirt, cravat, and up to two vests. The collar stands approximately 3 inches tall at the back of the neck when folded over. The front of the coat is cut broad and the back narrow, forcing an erect stance or may even throw the shoulders back. The fit is very close. The sleeves are very long, meaning to end at the wrist or longer, with the cuffs adding another 3 inches so that the sleeves with cuffs end at the knuckles of the hand. The sleeves fit very closely except at the top where they are puffed and full. The shoulders are cut very narrow. There are two separate tails that overlap at center back. The coat has an inside breast pocket and there are two tail pockets. The side of the front has two pocket flaps that cover the opening of the tail pockets. View A can be made with any wool. Views B and C have a collar that must be made with wool that does not ravel or ravels very little. View A lapel is a simple notched collar, which could be made with the upper collar of velvet if desired. View B is a wide M notch. View C is a wide touching M notch. Larks Tongue notch and is very pointed. View D is a wide M notch. View E is a long touching M notch. The instructions have both period and modern (theatrical) tailoring instructions. Information about fabric, interfacing, lining, fit, and supplies sources are included inside the pattern.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81xsPLNI53L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Laughing Moon","source_asin":"B015CSUECI","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1087600","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B015CSUECI","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B015CSUECI","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1087601,"name":"Pure Warmth Fleece Electric Heated Blanket Full Natural","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ZOgUf+-TL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Polyester SOFT AND COMFORTABLE – Never climb into cold sheets again. Electric Heated Blanket in ultra soft comfortable comfort knit fleece fabric. Twin and Full size include 1 controller. Queen and King size include 2 controllers. 100% Polyester. THERAPUETIC FULL BODY RELIEF WITH ADJUSTABLE HEAT SETTINGS – The cozy Comfort Knit Fleece blanket has ultra-thin heating wires for added comfort. The Digital Controller Includes Auto-off and 10 heat settings. SAFETY - ADVANCED TECHNOLOGY – The controller includes an auto shut-off timer for safety and reliability. All Pure Warmth Blankets are tested and approved by a 3rd party (UL or ETK Intertek) to comply with industry safety standards. MACHINE WASHABLE and EASY CARE – The blanket is machine washable and dryer safe for your convenience. Make sure to disconnect and remove controllers before washing. Do not use an extension cord or power strip for these blankets. WARRANTY - 5 year limited manufacturer's warranty.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ZOgUf+-TL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Pure Warmth","source_asin":"B076PMX6HL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1087601","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B076PMX6HL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B076PMX6HL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1087602,"name":"WWahuayuan 8/12 Channels Kitchen Timers Commercial Cooking Timer, Reminder Commercial Burger Bakery Restaurant Clock Loud Alarm Stainless Steel LED Di","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71cEUznCrQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Main Features 1. The program is easy and reliable, so the users can learn it quickly. 2. This timer is able to carry out 8 countdowns simultaneously which can be independently set and run without any interference. 3. The timer beeps after the countdown is over. Even in a noisy commercial kitchen, the volume of the timer can be noticeable. Moreover, the volume can be changed from loud to silent. 4. The timer has a memory function. The previous time setting remains even after the timer is powered off. 5. By default, the timer is set to the Minute: Second mode. Users can also switch it to the Hour: Minute mode. 6. The timer shell is made of stainless metal, which is strong and easy to clean. But the timer is not waterproof, so it cannot be washed. 7. This timer can be mounted on wall with a bracket according to the user's needs. 8. Plug and play. No batteries needed. Save batteries cost. Specifications Input voltage: AC 110v Power consumption: 3W Power cable: 1.5m/59inch power cord with US plug Product size: 320*115*42mm/ 12.60*4.75*1.65inch Packing size: 390*170*90mm/ 14.57*6.69*3.54inch How the buttons work? 1- The number keys 1 to 8 are used to start or cancel the corresponding digital window. 2- TIME button : Set the total time. 3- REMINDER button : Set the reminding time. 4- INCREASE button : Increase the time or the alarm volume of the buzzer. color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">5- DECREASE button : Decrease the time or the alarm volume of the buzzer. 6- ON/OFF button : Turn the timer on or off. What's in the box \"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">1x Digital Kitchen Timer 1x User Guide","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71cEUznCrQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"WWahuayuan","source_asin":"B08MQ3KWMW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1087602","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08MQ3KWMW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08MQ3KWMW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
