window.products.push({"id":1087610,"name":"Croscill Home Fashions Mystique 4-Piece Comforter Set, King, Claret","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ejOCsIRuL._AC_SL1305_.jpg","description":"A refreshing combination of traditional luxury and modern drama is offered in the beautiful Mystique large-scale formal paisley pattern, paired with relaxed plaid in an opulent claret color story. The comforter is claret chenille with dramatic large-scale paisley jacquard, twist cord trim detail and woven reverse.  Shams coordinate directly with the comforter face, with two-inch padded flange and twist cord trim. The 18\" bedskirt is solid gold with velvet ribbon accent and box kick pleats.  The Euro shams are reversible with plaid on one side and golden matelassé on the other. The square pillow coordinates with the face of the euro shams, featuring the relaxed plaid fabric and twist-cord trim. The fashion pillow features fine detailing, with an engineered paisley motif in the center framed by woven gimp and blocks of matelassé and shirred satin fabric, finished with twist-cord trim. The boudoir pillow features a large rectangle of matelassé fabric in the center, framed by sections of the main paisley fabric, with added decorative gimp accenting and tassel fringe on either side. Mystique window treatments include lined jacquard panels with tiebacks and a scalloped valance with tassel fringe, all in the beautiful claret chenille paisley design. To achieve the featured look, use two valances. Coordinating Mystique sheets of opulent gold are 300TC, 100-Percent cotton with 16\" pockets and feature tasteful medallion embroidery along the hems. Euro shams, decorative pillows, sheet sets, and drapes and valances are sold separately.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ejOCsIRuL._AC_SL1305_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Crocsill","source_asin":"B008YB1N3U","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1087610","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B008YB1N3U","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B008YB1N3U","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
