window.products.push({"id":1087630,"name":"Lodge Enamel on Cast Iron 11-Inch Skillet, Graduated Blue","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31R82AS14NL._AC_.jpg","description":"This reliable skillet from Lodge features the manufacturer's signature cast iron and two layers of very hard, glossy porcelain enamel. The cast iron construction provides superior heat distribution and retention along the bottom and sides. The excellent heat retention reduces the amount of energy needed for cooking. The skillet's strong surface resists scratches, stains, and the effects of everyday use, and the hygienic porcelain enamel is non-reactive with food. The skillet measures 11 inches in diameter and 1-3/4 inches deep. You can sauté, fry, and sear on the black matte porcelain surface (the use of vegetable oil or cooking spray is recommended), and the enamel eliminates the need to season the cast iron. The cast iron handle comes with a hanging hole for storage, and an additional helper handle makes lifting easy. Although practical, the attractive finish makes the skillet a great piece of serveware at the table. Lodge enamel cookware is safe for gas, electric, ceramic, and induction cooktops, and is oven safe to 400 degrees F. It's dishwasher-safe but hand washing is recommended to preserve its beauty. It carries a limited lifetime warranty.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31R82AS14NL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Lodge","source_asin":"B000GWE1SO","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1087630","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000GWE1SO","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000GWE1SO","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1087631,"name":"Curtis Stone 3-piece Dura-Pan Nonstick Nesting Skillet Set - Black, 0.79''H x 12.99'' Diameter","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31CxUXAtGUL._AC_.jpg","description":"Versatility meets convenience with these frypans. Featuring low walls, these pans maximize cooking space, making maximum possibilities for any meal. And once you're done cooking, these frypans nest together, so they don't take up too much space in your cabinet. Plus, with Dura-Pan nonstick technology, you get the trusted results you expect from any Curtis Stone cookware—delicious meals that are effortless to make and easy to clean up. Gift boxes are included, so you can spread the cheer and share with friends and family. (But remember to keep one for you.) WHAT YOU GET 8\" Low-walled frypan 10\" Low-walled frypan 13\" Low-walled frypan User guide with 10 recipes FEATURES Forged from a solid aluminum disc Quick heating and even cooking Can use on all cooktops including induction Oven safe to 450º F Dura-Pan nonstick coating Provides premium food release that lasts Aesthetically appealing speckled interior finish Metal utensil-safe (nylon, wooden or silicone utensils recommended to prolong the life of your nonstick coating) PFOA-free Formulated with 5-layer titanium nonstick coating that adds strength and durability Offers more than 4 times the strength of unreinforced nonstick coatings Double-riveted stainless steel buffet handles Help reduce heat absorption Designed for durability and comfort Allow pans to be used in the oven at temperatures of up to 450º F Low-sided walls Maximizes the cooking surface area, letting you cook more in one pan Makes cooking multiple foods at once easier to maneuver Makes pouring or sliding-out food quick and easy 3 different size frypans Versatile for a range of cooking styles and techniques Nest together with ease for maximizing storage space Maximizes your cooking surface area vs. traditional round frypans 3 gifts in 1 purchase","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31CxUXAtGUL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Curtis Stone","source_asin":"B09VR429T7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1087631","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09VR429T7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09VR429T7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
