window.products.push({"id":1087677,"name":"nuLOOM Derya Persian Vintage Area Rug, 6' 7\" x 9', Blue","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":102.13,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A1b1nOqciQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Indulge in the regal charm of this vintage medallion area rug. Channeling the flair of yesteryear with a stonewashed finish and delicate fringe, each piece has the look of a rare vintage find. Pair with traditional or modern décor, this floor covering is extremely versatile. Machine made in Turkey of soft polypropylene and is built to last in high traffic areas of your home. Never settle for anything but perfection with our pet-friendly and easy to care for area rugs.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A1b1nOqciQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"nuLOOM","source_asin":"B0B3SKKGBP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1087677","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B3SKKGBP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B3SKKGBP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
