window.products.push({"id":1087720,"name":"Mosscoff Copper martini glasses set of 2 9.5oz Hand hammered solid copper goblets with exquisite reinforcement ring. – Bonus pure copper straws – A gi","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":34.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91QzI2tTw+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"NO RISK TO CUT YOUR LIPS with a sharp metal edge of the goblet while drinking. Mosscoff exquisite reinforcement ring makes the copper glass strong and smooth that lets you drink in comfort, unlike the sharp edges found on other glasses. The ring is polished to perfection and gives additional charm and elegance to the goblet. Each Mosscoff copper martini goblets come in two pieces and needs one-time assembling but this is the best way to deliver them undamaged. PAY FOR PREMIUM QUALITY. Our solid copper martini glasses are made of 22-gauge thickness plate of 99.98% pure copper hallmark, most of the manufacturers use 99% - which makes a huge difference. Food safe lacquer on the outside of the goblet to save the luster and prevent from fast tarnishing. The base and the stem are made of brass and are copper plated to match the copper bowl. The brass stem will not transmit the heat from your hand when holding the glass. BONUS COPPER STRAWS. Mosscoff copper martini set of 2 is complete with 2 pure copper drinking straws that transmit the cold straight to your lips. Use it as a stirrer too! The straws have lacquer on the outside for the shine and are of perfect size to fit your beautiful copper goblet. 100% HANDCRAFTED – no two copper martini glasses are identical. Each one is unique, unmatched, and handcrafted in India by traditional copper artisans. You are protected with Mosscoff warranty! If you are not happy with your purchase - send us an email and we will make it right with you! A PERFECT GIFT. No one can resist your copper martini kit as a gift for weddings, anniversaries, birthdays, housewarming parties, bachelor or bachelorette parties, for the groomsmen or bridal showers, mother’s day, great gift for men and women to give thanks, or just because! Defected products replacement policy. Our products are totally handcrafted that is why some minor obstacles might occur. But we always offer replacements upon request in case you receive a defected item.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91QzI2tTw+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Mosscoff","source_asin":"B077Q4NJ25","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1087720","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B077Q4NJ25","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B077Q4NJ25","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
