window.products.push({"id":1087811,"name":"Collapsible Colander 2021 Upgrade, OBERLY Foldable Silicone Strainer Over the Sink with Extendable Handle, 6-Quart, Folding Squish Basket Kitchen for ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51DVEHAJs9L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Easy to Drain and Clean The perforation design is very easy to drain, widely used for draining most foods like spaghetti, pasta, potatoes, broccoli, green beans, carrots, spinach and other veggies. It could clean easily, wash with soapy warm water or place in dishwasher after use and keep dry. Convenient, Extendable Handles Sturdy handle design for comfortable holding when strain and drain food. The extendable handles could put over the sink, greatly enhance your effectiveness of kitchen work. Different Uses A Cute kitchen and home gift for housewarming parties, new couples, avid cooks, Mother's Day, bridal registry, and more. Or treat yourself to the ultimate kitchen strainer that makes food prep a snap! Specification: Material: PP+ Food Grade Rubber Size: 24*10.2*5.0 In（Expansion）& 15.25*10.2*1.85 In（Fold） Net Weight: 1.2 lb Package Included: 1 x Collapsible Colander Note: Please don't heat it on the flame directly. Please don't use it as a steamer in a pot. Avoid Using Sharp Thorn, Cut Basket Surface. Using Ordinary Detergent or Cleaner, Dishwasher Safe. Some Questions & answers from Our Customers Q: Will this hold up to straining boiling water from pasta? A: Yes, that's what I use it for, primarily. Q: Will they rinse beans & peas without falling through the holes? A: Yes, they will. I love them! Q: Are these usable hands free? Will stand on their own? A: Yes, they stand freely.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51DVEHAJs9L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"OBERLY","source_asin":"B08D3PMNCF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1087811","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08D3PMNCF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08D3PMNCF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1087812,"name":"FANCY FRAMES","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":8.44,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61z1Y+-UuNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Become your own chocolatier with CybrTrayd’s complete line of confectionary making supplies! We offer a variety of food-grade PETG plastic molds that are durable and can be reused for a multitude of projects. Create chocolates for all occasions using our traditional shapes for cookie and cake molds or invest in more elaborate 3-D designs. Each mold is sealed in a poly bag with CybrTrayd instructions imprinted on it. This will provide details on chocolate melting and molding for all our molds, including the hollow 3-D molds. In addition, we’ve provided some tips and tricks for getting the best possible results. All of our plastic designs can also be used for soap making. Additional directions are provided soap melt & pour techniques.To prevent any damage to your mold please wash by hand and do not put it in the dishwasher. These plastic molds are not meant to be used with hard candy. The molds are not suitable for children under 3 and should only be used by older children with adult supervision.Chocolates make great favors or treats for parties and other special occasions. Use the hearts, strawberries, rose and other flowers for romantic gestures such as wedding favors or a Valentine’s Day surprise. Trees, ornaments, candy canes and other festive references are perfect for the holiday season. All of our adorable baby molds are ideal for showers and gender reveal parties. You can also add pop sticks to some of the chocolates and create lollipop celebrations.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61z1Y+-UuNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CybrTrayd","source_asin":"B000EJM4PQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1087812","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000EJM4PQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000EJM4PQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
