window.products.push({"id":1087964,"name":"The Wizard of Oz 75th Anniversary (Wicked Witch) Framed and Matted Film Cell Minicell USFC6039","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":33.45,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71z17Oy8MuL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Released to celebrate the 75th Anniversary of the classic fantasy film, The Wizard of Oz, this is a sensational collectible 35mm film cell display featuring an authentic film clip from actual film reels of the movie. This great piece pays tribute to the Wicked Witch of the West, and includes a fine high resolution companion image, film cell mounted so that light can shine through, and information plate. You'll find a Certification of Authenticity sticker on the reverse side, as well as an easel stand for upright display. The components in the film cell display are professionally double-mounted and sealed behind acrylic for protection, and framed in elegant black ash. This minicell display measures 5\" x 7\", and is about 1\" thick, and comes to you carefully protected in a clear and durable plastic clamshell case, suitable for storage. Your cell may not match the one in the photograph. . . .cells are hand-selected from pivotal points in the film and will feature a fine shot of the Wicked Witch in action.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71z17Oy8MuL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"FILMCELLS","source_asin":"B00FZ81S58","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1087964","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00FZ81S58","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00FZ81S58","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1087965,"name":"Ice Cube Trays Easy Release 2 Pack, with Removable Lid Stackable Silicone Ice Cube Mold for Chilled Drinks, Whiskey, Cocktails","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51gQ075PDuL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Mwatcher believes that \"simple is beautiful\", so the design of the ice tray is simple, but it is simple to use and safe and durable FEATURES: 1.Convenience：TPE material shapes the bottom well, helping ice cubes slide out effortlessly. Only need pat the bottom and push it2.Removable Lids：The ice cube trays easy to stacked, and keep ice cubes from absorbing freezer odors. 3.Multipurpose：Perfect for making ice cubes or filling the trays with juice, fruit, jelly, chocolate, sauces and pudding. 4.Easy to Clean：You can put this ice cube trays under the water tap to wash after use. Of course, it is also dishwasher safe. How to Use： 1. Clean it with hot water to before first use 2.Fill the ice trays with water and close thelid，But not add too much water in case the ice sticking together 3. After taking the ice tray out of the refrigerator, don't rush to take out the ice cube, first pour the water over it for a while orsoak for a while.4. Open the ice tray lid and press the silicone section of the ice tray to remove the ice Kindly Tips: 1. Please wipe out the trays with soft cloth，Do not use metal brush to clean these ice cube trays；2.Keep these ice cube trays awayfrom fire sources in case they get distorted； Specifications: 1. Color: Pink and Green 2.Material: BPA Free silicone3. Dimensions: 10.03 × 4.7 × 1.18inch / 25.5×12×3cm (L × W × H 1 Pack) 4.Size of each ice cube: 0.98 ×0.98 ×1.18 in (appros)5.Weight: 132g/4.65oz (1 Pack) 6.Package Content:2 × Ice Cube Trays Any problems about commodity which you buy from us, please let us know. Mwatcher will try the best to solve it.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51gQ075PDuL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Fa So La","source_asin":"B089YS9FW4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1087965","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B089YS9FW4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B089YS9FW4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
